inscriptions.inscription:
7 additional inscriptions, and 15 additional seals: 

1 inscription and 1 seal of Gu Yinguang 顧胤光 (16th-17th c.); 
1 inscription and 3 seals of Shan Xun 單恂 (?-1650); 
4 inscriptions and 8 seals of Pei Jingfu 裴景福 (1854–1926); 
1 inscription of Hu Bicheng 胡璧城 (19th-20th c.); 
3 seals unidentified.
